  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Artistry or Craft 6 ranks, Artifice sphere (Confident Craftsmanship).</p>\n<p>You may craft much faster than normal. Whenever you craft a magical item using an Artistry or Craft skill you have unlocked skill leverage for, the time required to craft the object is reduced by half.</p>\n<p>At 12 ranks in the associated skill, the time required to craft a magical item is reduced by two-thirds instead of half.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/artifice#toc67\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
